/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:293:        "transform": "remove divider, shift gray into the left canvas, then append one segment per glyph while moving downward; segment length+orientation are determined by glyph type (area 4→vertical len2; area 5→horizontal len3 right; area 6→horizontal len4 left; area 7→horizontal len2 left)"
