/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/4/code.py:20:# - D5/0 changes both marker reading and ray travel: sprites are transparent to the ray logic.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/64efde09/4/code.py:21:#   A boundary marker may sit "behind" another sprite, and an output ray keeps stepping after
